<title>UK: Copper closes firm, zinc also ends strong on LME.</title>
<headline>Copper closes firm, zinc also ends strong on LME.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Closes firm, but baulks at test of $2,300. Spread activity volatile ahead of &quot;third Wednesday.&quot; Cash/threes backwardation at $135.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Woken up by copper in PM, finishes higher.</p>
<p>ZINC - Ends firm, nears $1,495 recent high as contango shrinks.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Races above $6,900, ends firm.</p>
<p>LEAD - Closes higher. TIN - Quiet, ends steadier.</p>
</text>
